  "details": "Please give us the ability to tag a world ai generated or fake or prefab, if the world doesn't actually do or look like what it represents.  \n\nThere are too many worlds that say or show one thing, only to be something entirely different from what it's supposed to be once you get there. I'm hoping if we can't have preview pictures we could at least tag the world. \n\nSome of us only get to see and hangout with our friends for a limited time and if you're in a world hopping mood, nothing is worse than back to back slop worlds that are nothing like the art posted on the world's description. \n\nIt really needs to stop. This is a step in the right direction.",
